    "status": "present",
    "value": "Implement a skip list supporting search, duplicate insertion, and deletion of one matching occurrence. The approach is: randomized forward-tower skip list; duplicate values occupy distinct nodes and erase removes one. Its target cost is expected O(log n) methods/O(n) expected storage under independent geometric levels; fixed16 levels for this domain. Treat the invariant underlying that approach as the reason each local update preserves the required result. Check it against an independent bounded reference before relying on large-domain constructions."
  },
